<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Selectors</title>
    <style>
        body{
            background-color: antiquewhite; 
            font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif ;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
          }
          h1{
            color: black;
          }
          h1+p{background-color: orange;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            color: #dc0b00;
            display: inline-block;


          }
          ul{
            padding:0;
            margin-top: 20px;
          }
          ul>li{
        color:#dc0b00;
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 6px auto;
        background-color: coral;
        width: 250px;
        list-style: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
          }
          ul li:nth-child(3){
            background-color: darkorange;
            color: brown;
          }
          a{
            background-color: orange;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 20px;
            border: 2px solid orange;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            margin: 0px 12px;
          }
          a:hover{
            background-color: red;
            color: white;
          }
          .desc::first-letter{
            font-size: 220%;
            color: darkorange;
            font-weight: bold

          }
          .links{
            margin-top: 25px;
            
          }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>My Food Menu</h1>
    <p>Pick Your Favorite Dish</p><br>
    <ul>
        <li>Pizza</li>
        <li>Burgers</li>
        <li>Tacos</li>
        <li>Noodles</li>
        <li>Ice Cream</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="desc">
        Every dish on this menu is made with love and lots of flavor. Try them all and find your favorite! 
    </p>
    <div class="links">
        <a href="#">Order Now</a>
        <a href="#">See More</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
